        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/870acb79a0ec054a4cf9bcc6d5638bdb.avif?t=1786054596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ This is <i>not</i> an idle game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunk &amp; Doggo</strong> is a desktop companion app where two quiet souls live their peaceful lives in the corner of your screen.<br>It’s not about efficiency or automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it offers a calm, gentle presence.<br>Just keep it running — and their quiet days will unfold on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/f56a65c7e1eb6ab64f58f39fb5626aac.apng?t=1786054596\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/f56a65c7e1eb6ab64f58f39fb5626aac.poster.avif?t=1786054596\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Hunk — A quiet, clumsy middle-aged miner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn’t say much, but he keeps mining steadily.<br>He seems content with his quiet life alongside Doggo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/188cdefdcf6f45c3e39d2a77118c6ffc.apng?t=1786054596\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/188cdefdcf6f45c3e39d2a77118c6ffc.poster.avif?t=1786054596\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Doggo — A carefree and curious companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He mimics Hunk’s digging, gets soaked when it rains, and runs around the screen doing whatever he likes.<br>He lives freely — just being himself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ An app where you don’t <i>need</i> to do anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even as the level rises, your role doesn’t change.<br>You <i>can</i> interact — collect falling grass, pop a balloon — but you don’t have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the keyboard triggers something, sometimes it rains.<br>These small changes are subtle and satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Includes a simple Pomodoro timer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in <strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> helps you manage focus and rest.<br>While you work, Hunk and Doggo quietly keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Doesn’t get in the way — but you might want it always on</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s designed to stay out of your way,<br>but you may find yourself wanting it there all the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just above the taskbar, in the corner of your screen —<br>a peaceful companion for your desktop.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/870acb79a0ec054a4cf9bcc6d5638bdb.avif?t=1786054596\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ This is <i>not</i> an idle game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunk &amp; Doggo</strong> is a desktop companion app where two quiet souls live their peaceful lives in the corner of your screen.<br>It’s not about efficiency or automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it offers a calm, gentle presence.<br>Just keep it running — and their quiet days will unfold on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/f56a65c7e1eb6ab64f58f39fb5626aac.apng?t=1786054596\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/f56a65c7e1eb6ab64f58f39fb5626aac.poster.avif?t=1786054596\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Hunk — A quiet, clumsy middle-aged miner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn’t say much, but he keeps mining steadily.<br>He seems content with his quiet life alongside Doggo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/188cdefdcf6f45c3e39d2a77118c6ffc.apng?t=1786054596\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926020/extras/188cdefdcf6f45c3e39d2a77118c6ffc.poster.avif?t=1786054596\" class=\"bb_img\" width=80 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Doggo — A carefree and curious companion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He mimics Hunk’s digging, gets soaked when it rains, and runs around the screen doing whatever he likes.<br>He lives freely — just being himself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ An app where you don’t <i>need</i> to do anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even as the level rises, your role doesn’t change.<br>You <i>can</i> interact — collect falling grass, pop a balloon — but you don’t have to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the keyboard triggers something, sometimes it rains.<br>These small changes are subtle and satisfying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Includes a simple Pomodoro timer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in <strong>Pomodoro timer</strong> helps you manage focus and rest.<br>While you work, Hunk and Doggo quietly keep you company.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Doesn’t get in the way — but you might want it always on</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s designed to stay out of your way,<br>but you may find yourself wanting it there all the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just above the taskbar, in the corner of your screen —<br>a peaceful companion for your desktop.</p>",
